# Row polymorphism: function that projects a field
# get-name accepts any record with at least `name: String`.
# Called with two different records with different extra fields.
[get-name: [fn [r@[name: String ...]] [call $get $r name]]
 r1: [call $get-name [name: alice  age: 30]]
 r2: [call $get-name [name: bob  city: NYC]]]
===
Dict({"get-name": Function(r), "r1": String("alice"), "r2": String("bob")})
